"  K_43 has 903 edges = 2^903 possible colorings!" print
"  Even with symmetry, search space is astronomical" print
"" print

"Effect algebra approach for R(5,5) search:" print
"  - Each edge coloring decision = 1 effect" print
"  - Constraint: no monochromatic K_5" print
"  - Find coloring with all constraints satisfied" print
"  - If found for K_43 → lower bound holds" print
"  - If impossible → try smaller graphs" print
